  -- label: change of variables x = e^u
  -- claim: $\operatorname{supp}\psi\subseteq(0,\infty) \Rightarrow \int_{\mathbb R} e^u\psi(e^u)\,du=\int_{\mathbb R}\psi(x)\,dx$
  -- The substitution x = e^u maps ℝ onto (0, ∞), where ψ lives.
